-- DROPZONE | Bots + Items + Players ESP + No Recoil + No Spread
-- INSERT = open/close menu, drag the title bar to move it
--
-- Item colors:
--   helmet / vest / backpack lvl 1 = yellow, lvl 2 = blue, lvl 3 = red
--   ammo = cyan, scopes = purple, everything else = grey
--
-- No recoil / No spread:
--   Both work on the live weapon tables found on the Luau heap.
--   The first time you tick either one, a one-time scan (getgc) runs and
--   the game freezes for ~40-50s. After that writes are instant.
--   Only numeric slots are touched and only inside tables that carry the
--   weapon signature, so UI strings / unrelated tables are left alone.
--
--   The game rebuilds those tables when you swap weapons / get in a
--   vehicle, so the script watches the equipped tool and re-scans by
--   itself ("Auto rescan", on by default). Writes are paused the moment
--   the tool changes, so nothing is ever written into freed memory.
--   Turning "Auto rescan" off keeps the old addresses; the manual
--   "Rescan weapons" row then does it by hand.
--
